  "last_activity_at": "2026-07-24T20:05:31.824Z",
  "latest_note": "Extracted matchTicketByRef (overlays.ts) as the single ref-matching implementation; FixtureDataSource.findTicketByRef now delegates to it. handleTicketDetail now fetches listTickets() once and matches the ref in-memory instead of also calling findTicketByRef (which re-scanned the tickets dir). listEventsForTicket gained an optional knownSessions param so handleTicketDetail's already-fetched sessions are reused instead of listEventsForTicket re-scanning the sessions dir internally. Net: one tickets-dir scan and one sessions-dir scan per ticket-detail request, down from two each. Regression tests: a counting WebDataSource fake in ticket-detail.test.ts asserts exact call counts (confirmed it fails against the old code), plus new matchTicketByRef unit tests in overlays.test.ts. Filed t-ssjxh as the explicitly-out-of-scope cross-request caching follow-up. Full verification suite green.",
